{"id":"mirno","lemma":"мирно","pos":"adv","rank":4104,"glosses":["peacefully"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0f/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Так мирно.","en":"It's so peaceful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/140387","words":[{"g":"so"},null]},{"text":"Раньше здесь было мирно.","en":"It used to be peaceful here.","words":[{"g":"earlier"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Почему мы не можем просто жить все мирно?","en":"Why can't we all just live in peace?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},{"g":"to live"},{"g":"everyone, everybody"},null]},{"text":"Том мирно спал.","en":"Tom slept peacefully.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"to sleep","l":"спать"}]},{"text":"Коровы мирно паслись.","en":"The cows grazed peacefully.","words":[{"g":"cow","l":"корова"},null,null]}]}